<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Deccan Rise: Pune – an open-world game by Nexora Interactive</title>
<meta name="description" content="Deccan Rise: Pune is an open-world game set in Pune, built in Godot 4 by Nexora Interactive. Still in development. Join the early group.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@600;800&family=Hind:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --yellow: #F5B800;
    --asphalt: #1F2326;
    --paper: #F4F6F5;
    --green: #1F6B4F;
    --red: #B23A2B;
    --muted: #5A6266;
    --line: #CBD1D0;
    --display: "Bricolage Grotesque", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --body: "Hind", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: var(--body); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--asphalt); background: var(--paper); }
  a { color: var(--green); }
  :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--asphalt); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .wrap { max-width: 64rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

  /* Hero */
  .hero { background: var(--yellow); padding: 3.5rem 0 4.5rem; }
  .studio { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  .board { display: inline-block; background: var(--asphalt); color: var(--yellow); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; border-bottom: 6px solid var(--red); }
  .board .big { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.1; display: block; }
  .board .small { font-size: 1rem; display: block; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
  .hero h1 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 9vw, 6rem); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; max-width: 12ch; }
  .hero p { font-size: 1.25rem; max-width: 36rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .status { display: inline-block; border: 2px solid var(--asphalt); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.15rem 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .hero .release { font-weight: 600; margin: 0.75rem 0 2rem; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; background: var(--asphalt); color: var(--paper); text-decoration: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem; border: 0; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
  .btn:hover { background: #000; }

  /* Sections */
  section { padding: 4rem 0; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .intro { max-width: 40rem; margin: 0; }

  /* Features: a plain list, separated by rules */
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(17rem, 1fr)); gap: 0 3rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .features li { border-top: 3px solid var(--asphalt); padding: 1rem 0 1.75rem; }
  .features h3 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 0.35rem; }
  .features p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

  /* First playable area: stops along a route */
  .route { list-style: none; margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding: 0 0 0 2rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--asphalt); max-width: 40rem; }
  .route li { position: relative; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .route li:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .route li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -2.6rem; top: 0.4rem; width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--yellow); border: 4px solid var(--asphalt); }

  /* Signup */
  .signup { background: var(--asphalt); color: var(--paper); }
  .signup p { max-width: 36rem; }
  form { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 36rem; }
  label { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }
  input[type="email"] { flex: 1 1 16rem; font: inherit; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; border: 2px solid var(--paper); border-radius: 4px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--asphalt); }
  .signup .btn { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--asphalt); }
  .signup .btn:hover { background: #ffc61f; }
  .signup .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: wait; }
  .signup :focus-visible { outline-color: var(--yellow); }
  .hp { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }
  #msg { flex-basis: 100%; margin: 0; min-height: 1.6em; }
  #msg a { color: var(--yellow); }

  /* Contact + footer */
  .contact p { max-width: 36rem; }
  footer { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="studio">Nexora Interactive</p>
    <div class="board" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="big">पुणे</span>
      <span class="small">Next stop: early access</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Deccan Rise: Pune</h1>
    <p>An open-world game set in Pune, built in Godot 4. Heavy traffic, potholed roads, a working metro and a story to follow.</p>
    <span class="status">Still in development</span>
    <p class="release">First build (0.1) planned for 27 March 2027.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#join">Join the early group</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What it is</h2>
      <p class="intro">Deccan Rise: Pune is an open-world game in the spirit of GTA, built around everyday Pune. It is made by Nexora Interactive in Godot 4, with a stylised art style and lightweight performance. The game is still in development.</p>
      <ul class="features">
        <li>
          <h3>Learning AI traffic</h3>
          <p>Traffic driven by learning AI, with the intense congestion and potholed roads Pune is known for.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A working metro</h3>
          <p>A metro system built to match the real one.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A city that changes</h3>
          <p>Map updates show buildings under construction that are completed over time.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Inside the buildings</h3>
          <p>You can go inside a few buildings.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A working storyline</h3>
          <p>An open city with a story to follow.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Built in Godot 4</h3>
          <p>Lightweight performance with a stylised art style.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>First playable area</h2>
      <p class="intro">The first area you can play will cover these parts of Pune.</p>
      <ul class="route">
        <li>Deccan</li>
        <li>Shivajinagar</li>
        <li>FC Road</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="signup" id="join">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Join the early group</h2>
      <p>Leave your email and Nexora Interactive will write to you when there is something to play or test. Nothing else, and you can ask to be removed at any time.</p>
      <form id="signup-form" novalidate>
        <label for="email">Your email address</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required>
        <input class="hp" type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <button class="btn" type="submit" id="submit-btn">Join the group</button>
        <p id="msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Questions or ideas</h2>
      <p>Got a question, a bug to report, or a place in Pune the game should have? Write to <a id="contact-link" href="#">us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">Deccan Rise: Pune is in development at Nexora Interactive. © 2026 Nexora Interactive.</div>
</footer>

<script>
  // Signups and questions go to this address.
  const OWNER_EMAIL = "ayukun.jir@gmail.com";

  const contactLink = document.getElementById("contact-link");
  contactLink.href = "mailto:" + OWNER_EMAIL;
  contactLink.textContent = OWNER_EMAIL;

  const form = document.getElementById("signup-form");
  const msg = document.getElementById("msg");
  const btn = document.getElementById("submit-btn");

  form.addEventListener("submit", async function (e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    const email = form.email.value.trim();
    if (!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)) {
      msg.textContent = "Enter a valid email address, like name@example.com.";
      return;
    }
    if (form._honey.value) return; // bots fill this hidden field
    btn.disabled = true;
    msg.textContent = "Adding you…";
    try {
      const res = await fetch("https://formsubmit.co/ajax/" + encodeURIComponent(OWNER_EMAIL), {
        method: "POST",
        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept": "application/json" },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          email: email,
          _subject: "New early-access signup: Deccan Rise: Pune",
          _template: "table"
        })
      });
      if (!res.ok) throw new Error("bad response");
      form.reset();
      msg.textContent = "You’re in. We’ll email you when there’s something to try.";
    } catch (err) {
      msg.innerHTML = "Couldn’t save your email. Try again, or write to <a href=\"mailto:" + OWNER_EMAIL + "\">" + OWNER_EMAIL + "</a>.";
    } finally {
      btn.disabled = false;
    }
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
